<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sistem Informasi Kelulusan | SMAN 2 MOJOKERTO</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- PRELOADER -->
    <div id="preloader">
        <div class="loader-content">
            <img src="logo_sman2.jpg" alt="Logo" class="loader-logo">
            <div class="loader-bar"></div>
            <p>Memuat Sistem...</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="app">
        <!-- SLIDE 1: LOGIN -->
        <section id="login-slide" class="slide active">
            <div class="login-card">
                <img src="logo_sman2.jpg" alt="Logo SMAN 2" class="school-logo-login">
                <h1>Sistem Informasi Kelulusan</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">SMAN 2 MOJOKERTO 2026</p>
                <form id="login-form">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Username</label>
                        <input type="text" id="username" placeholder="Username (1234)" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Password</label>
                        <input type="password" id="password" placeholder="Password (1234)" required>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-login">Masuk</button>
                </form>
                <p id="error-msg" class="error-msg">Akses Ditolak! Gunakan 1234</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SLIDE 2: HASIL -->
        <section id="result-slide" class="slide">
            <nav class="top-nav">
                <div class="user-info">Hai MOCHAMAD DIN PANULUH</div>
                <a href="#" id="logout-btn" class="logout-link">Logout</a>
            </nav>

            <div class="result-content">
                <p class="app-title">Aplikasi Kelulusan SMAN 2 MOJOKERTO 2026</p>
                <h2 class="student-name">MOCHAMAD DIN PANULUH</h2>
                
                <div class="status-container">
                    <div class="status-badge">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="status-text">Maaf, Anda Tidak Lulus</h3>
                </div>

                <div class="info-message">
                    <p>Bagi yg tidak lulus, tetap semangat! Teruslah belajar dan jangan menyerah. Kesuksesan menanti di depan.</p>
                    <p class="try-again">Mohon maaf coba lagi</p>
                </div>

                <div class="visitor-section">
                    <p>Anda pengunjung ke :</p>
                    <div class="visitor-card">
                        <span class="v-label">VisitorCounter</span>
                        <span class="v-number">3413</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
